    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Healthcare Assistants (HCAs) provide valuable assistance to nurses and work closely with patients to ensure their comfort and safety. This is why it is crucial that they are updated with the latest knowledge and skills. The Kidney and Bladder Service Line in collaboration with CIME offered this one-day refresher workshop for HCAs. The learners were challenged as they performed care in a range of simulation scenarios featuring patients with urological disorders.",
